Subject: [PATCH 3/5] RISCV: Add SFPU scheduling models (TensixBH/TensixWH)

Add per-processor scheduling models with 5 sub-unit resources (Load, Simple,
MAD, Round, Store) and per-instruction latencies. Addresses GH-Q-006 (the #1
codegen quality issue in sfpi-gcc: missing pipeline model).

